# Layer 3, business flow "fix42-chaining": FIX 4.2 order flow keyed by the
# chaining key generator, published to by the fix42-publisher module.
#
# Nothing here needs to differ from the repo defaults -- same ports, same
# binary, same platform. This file exists so every flow folder has the same
# two files and the layering order stays uniform; see
# docs/src/server-env-layering.md.
#
# The one thing worth knowing about this flow is not an environment variable:
# it loads an OPTIONAL module (libamps_id_chaining_key_generator.so). If your
# AMPS build does not ship it, the server refuses to start and names it. List
# what a build has with:
#
#   ./server/scripts/amps.sh modules
